    "body": "@annevk perhaps the most effective change would be to remove the reference to 304 in Step 7.4 of https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-network-or-cache-fetch, and instead write something like: \"if `revalidationFlag` is set: set response to the result of handling `forwardResponse` according to https://httpwg.org/http-core/draft-ietf-httpbis-cache-latest.html#rfc.section.4.3.3\"?",
