    "created_at": "2020-06-25T16:50:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-25T16:50:37Z",
    "body": "I think we should keep it open to track the issue where we set the revalidatingFlag and get a 304 but somehow not have a valid cached response. That needs addressing somehow and I don't think it can be fixed solely upstream given our current logic.",
